    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5084" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμβροτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			75.17
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Tim.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			7
		</span></i>: (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροτός</span>):— poet.
			Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>immortal, divine,</i> of
			persons as well as things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.358
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.445
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				10.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					259
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμβροτε Φάμα,</span> of
			an oracle, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				158
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> epith.
			of all <i>belonging to the gods,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.339
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.381
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεύχεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.194
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρήδεμνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.347
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.222
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.330
				</span></i>
			:—also <i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i>, =
			<i>five,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theol.Ar.
				32
			</span></i>.</div>
